OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny isolated overnight showers
OL,6,Fsoon easing. A mostly dry day follows,
OL,7,Fwith early cloud breaking to good
OL,8,Fsunny spells. Cloud then builds
OL,9,Fthrough the afternoon, with a few
OL,10,Fshowers developing into the evening,
OL,11,Fperhaps heavy. Breezy, especially
OL,12,Falong Essex coasts.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FStaying rather breezy with
OL,15,Fscattered showers spreading east
OL,16,Fovernight. These could be heavy at
OL,17,Ftimes, before gradually easing around
OL,18,Fdawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
